Package: epikinetics
Title: Biomarker Kinetics Modelling
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Tim", "Russell", email = "timothy.russell@lshtm.ac.uk", role = c("aut")),
    person("Alex", "Hill", email = "alex.hill@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Author: Tim Russell [aut], Alex Hill [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Tim Russell <timothy.russell@lshtm.ac.uk>
Description: Fit Bayesian hierarchical models of longitudinal biomarker
    kinetics after a focal exposure. A functional R interface prepares data,
    runs a threaded 'Stan' model through 'CmdStanR', and provides labelled
    posterior parameters, diagnostics, predictions, and plots.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cmdstanr,
    ggplot2,
    grid,
    matrixStats,
    posterior,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Additional_repositories:
    https://stan-dev.r-universe.dev
SystemRequirements: CmdStan (>= 2.26), C++17
Suggests:
    knitr,
    ragg,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website:
    pkgdown
URL: https://seroanalytics.org/epikinetics/,
    https://github.com/seroanalytics/epikinetics
